      "html": "<section id=\"section-services-stats\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-24 max-md:py-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-md:grid-cols-1\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full w-full ui-glass ui-glass--chalk ui-glass--edge-rounded\" data-v-fb63fbe4><div class=\"ui-glass__content\" data-v-fb63fbe4></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 p-8\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Search visibility</p><p class=\"text-base leading-snug text-slatecolor/70\">SEO, GEO, AEO and AIO for how customers discover your business through search and AI answers.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full w-full ui-glass ui-glass--chalk ui-glass--edge-rounded\" data-v-fb63fbe4><div class=\"ui-glass__content\" data-v-fb63fbe4></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 p-8\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Paid media</p><p class=\"text-base leading-snug text-slatecolor/70\">Google Ads, Meta Ads and TikTok Ads connected to audience intent, creative testing and conversions.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full w-full ui-glass ui-glass--chalk ui-glass--edge-rounded\" data-v-fb63fbe4><div class=\"ui-glass__content\" data-v-fb63fbe4></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 p-8\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Content strategy</p><p class=\"text-base leading-snug text-slatecolor/70\">Articles, blogs and social content shaped by a clear editorial plan and customer journey.</p></div></div></div></div></section>"
