      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "relative w-full"
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"bg-charcoal relative w-full overflow-clip py-32\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"detail-section__backdrop pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 max-md:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"detail-section__backdrop-sticky flex justify-end px-gutter\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"detail-section__backdrop-visual\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden\" data-v-7d0248b3><span></span></div></div></div></div><section id=\"pillar-search-and-ai-visibility\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full section-shell--nav-clearance pointer-events-auto relative z-10\" style=\"\" data-v-7d0248b3 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"@container flex w-full flex-col max-md:gap-12 gap-20\" data-v-7d0248b3 data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"relative hidden aspect-square w-full max-md:mx-auto max-md:block max-md:w-4/5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\" data-v-208a8e74><span></span></div></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__intro\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-208a8e74><h2 class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-208a8e74><span class=\"text-spark max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Search &amp; AI Visibility</span><span class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\">Get found in search and AI answers.</span></h2><div class=\"two-column-copy two-column-copy--stacked\" data-v-208a8e74 data-v-5524b3ea><div class=\"two-column-copy__group\" data-v-5524b3ea><p class=\"two-column-copy__paragraph tracking-tight text-haze-300\" data-v-5524b3ea><span>Customers discover businesses through search results, AI answers and the content they trust. A strong presence connects those moments instead of treating each channel as a separate task. We bring SEO, GEO, AEO and AIO into one strategy: understanding your audience, finding the questions that matter, and making your expertise clear across the pages and platforms they use. The goal is relevant discovery that leads to enquiries and sales, supported by a sound technical foundation and content people can use.</span></p></div><div class=\"two-column-copy__group\" data-v-5524b3ea><p class=\"two-column-copy__paragraph tracking-tight text-haze-300\" data-v-5524b3ea><span>Your search presence needs a joined-up plan. We audit what can be crawled and indexed, map the questions your customers ask, and prioritise the pages that deserve attention. Content briefs, internal links and structured data become part of a practical publishing plan. We track relevant visibility, visits, enquiries and conversions, and review AI answer mentions where they can be observed. Explore our </span><a href=\"/services#service-seo\" class=\"text-chalk underline underline-offset-4 decoration-chalk/50 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out hover:text-spark hover:decoration-spark/60\">SEO strategy</a><span>, </span><a href=\"/services#service-answer-optimisation\" class=\"text-chalk underline underline-offset-4 decoration-chalk/50 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out hover:text-spark hover:decoration-spark/60\">GEO, AEO &amp; AIO</a><span> and </span><a href=\"/services#service-ai-search-visibility\" class=\"text-chalk underline underline-offset-4 decoration-chalk/50 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out hover:text-spark hover:decoration-spark/60\">AI search visibility</a><span> services.</span></p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\" data-v-208a8e74><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-haze-300\">How we help</p><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3.5 pt-7\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">SEO audits &amp; technical search foundations</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Keyword research &amp; search-intent mapping</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">GEO, AEO &amp; AIO for answer-led discovery</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">AI search visibility across ChatGPT &amp; more</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Content structure, schema &amp; entity clarity</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Topic clusters &amp; internal linking</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Local SEO &amp; business profile optimisation</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Visibility, enquiry &amp; conversion reporting</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__offerings\" data-v-208a8e74><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-haze-900\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 id=\"service-seo\" class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">SEO Strategy &amp; Optimisation</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-300 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Build an organic search foundation around relevant intent. We plan keyword and competitor research, technical SEO, on-page optimisation, local SEO and topic clusters, with priorities tied to the enquiries and sales your business needs.</p></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-haze-900\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 id=\"service-answer-optimisation\" class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">GEO, AEO &amp; AIO</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-300 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Make your expertise easier for answer engines and generative search to understand. We shape clear answers, entity information, structured data and source-supported content, connecting GEO, AEO and AIO in one search strategy.</p></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-haze-900\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 id=\"service-ai-search-visibility\" class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">AI Search Visibility</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-300 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Understand how your brand appears in AI-assisted discovery. We review the questions your audience asks, identify gaps in how your business is represented, and prioritise useful content and authority signals across experiences such as ChatGPT and Google AI search.</p></article></div><div class=\"border-charcoal/40 bg-charcoal/40 h-px w-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-208a8e74></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__proof\" data-v-208a8e74><figure class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl h-full min-h-0 max-md:h-auto\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"relative z-10 h-full min-h-0 w-full max-md:h-auto\"><div class=\"content-image content-image--fill\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRlgAAABXRUJQVlA4IEwAAADwAwCdASogAB0APzF+uVOuqCYisAwB0CYJYgDHMFveuMW3s4oeOpdQAP7v+Ym4ZS1NGPD2iTD8AR3y1/KpY2wSRp5bxCoVdt42gAAA);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><img src=\"/service-assets/search-strategy.svg\" alt=\"Search strategy: audience questions, useful answers and connected visibility\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover object-top max-md:h-auto max-md:object-contain content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></picture></div></div></figure><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-v-208a8e74><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"clickable-block flex flex-col gap-4 no-underline text-inherit\" data-v-208a8e74><p class=\"text-sm uppercase leading-normal tracking-widest text-haze-300\" data-v-208a8e74>Start with visibility</p><p class=\"text-2xl leading-normal tracking-tight text-chalk\" data-v-208a8e74>A search and AI visibility audit</p><p class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-haze-300\" data-v-208a8e74>Map where your business is found today, which questions matter to your customers, and where clearer pages, better content and stronger technical foundations could help. Leave with priorities for your next growth plan.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-spark\" data-v-208a8e74> Talk to us <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-208a8e74>→</span></span></a><figure class=\"border-l-2 border-spark pl-6\" data-v-208a8e74><blockquote class=\"max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-4xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-chalk\">Be discoverable when someone is looking for what your business does.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"flex flex-col gap-0 pt-6\"><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-300\">Our search principle</p><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal opacity-70 text-haze-300\">Fyntix</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div class=\"view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"bg-soft-grey relative w-full overflow-clip py-32\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"detail-section__backdrop pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 max-md:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"detail-section__backdrop-sticky flex justify-end px-gutter\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"detail-section__backdrop-visual\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden\" data-v-7d0248b3><span></span></div></div></div></div><section id=\"pillar-paid-media-and-content\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full pointer-events-auto relative z-10\" style=\"\" data-v-7d0248b3 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"@container flex w-full flex-col max-md:gap-12 gap-20\" data-v-7d0248b3 data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"relative hidden aspect-square w-full max-md:mx-auto max-md:block max-md:w-4/5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\" data-v-208a8e74><span></span></div></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__intro\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-208a8e74><h2 class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-208a8e74><span class=\"text-spark max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Paid Media &amp; Content</span><span class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Turn attention into enquiries and sales.</span></h2><div class=\"two-column-copy two-column-copy--stacked\" data-v-208a8e74 data-v-5524b3ea><div class=\"two-column-copy__group\" data-v-5524b3ea><p class=\"two-column-copy__paragraph tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-5524b3ea><span>Paid media and content work best when they tell the same story. We connect Google Ads, Meta Ads, TikTok Ads and wider social media advertising with the articles, blogs and social content your audience needs. We start with your offer, audience and growth goals, then plan the messaging, creative and content flow from first discovery to the next meaningful action.</span></p></div><div class=\"two-column-copy__group\" data-v-5524b3ea><p class=\"two-column-copy__paragraph tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-5524b3ea><span>A campaign needs more than a budget, and content needs more than a publishing schedule. We plan how each ad, article, blog and landing page supports the customer journey, with research, briefs, editorial calendars and creative testing connected to one strategy. Tracking and regular reviews help show which messages and channels contribute to enquiries and sales, so the next decision follows evidence rather than activity alone.</span></p></div></div><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pointer-events-auto w-fit\" data-v-208a8e74><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-haze-300 text-slatecolor bg-chalk hover:bg-haze hover:border-haze-300 font-medium text-sm leading-normal py-3.5 px-5\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Plan your growth strategy</span></button></a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\" data-v-208a8e74><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight text-haze-800\">How we help</p><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3.5 pt-7\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Google Ads &amp; search campaign strategy</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Meta Ads across Facebook &amp; Instagram</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">TikTok Ads &amp; social media advertising</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Creative testing &amp; landing-page strategy</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Articles, blogs &amp; social content creation</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none text-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span><span class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Editorial calendars &amp; customer-journey planning</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__offerings\" data-v-208a8e74><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-chalk\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 id=\"service-google-ads\" class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Google Ads</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Reach people looking for what you offer. We connect keyword intent, campaign structure, budgets, ad copy and landing pages with conversion tracking, then use a clear testing and optimisation plan to guide decisions about spend.</p></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-chalk\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 id=\"service-paid-social\" class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Meta &amp; TikTok Ads</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Build paid social campaigns for Facebook, Instagram and TikTok around audience insight and platform-appropriate creative. We plan targeting, messaging, creative tests and remarketing, with reporting tied to enquiries, sales and acquisition costs.</p></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-chalk\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 id=\"service-content-strategy\" class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">Content Strategy &amp; Creation</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Turn expertise into articles, blogs, ad copy and social content with a clear purpose. We plan topics, briefs, editorial calendars and the flow from discovery to consideration and action, then create content that supports your search and campaign strategy.</p></article></div><div class=\"border-haze bg-haze h-px w-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-208a8e74></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__proof\" data-v-208a8e74><figure class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl h-full min-h-0 max-md:h-auto\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"relative z-10 h-full min-h-0 w-full max-md:h-auto\"><div class=\"content-image content-image--fill\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRnQAAABXRUJQVlA4IGgAAAAQBQCdASogAB0APy2EtFOuqSUisAwB0CWJYgCC5QiubK4b6gjY5r9COEmEPMEqGqgAAPuRbt8lnw/ffMuK99XetEmfPFhfzCz/wJHbBY+cn+OCevsajdph/p0NE8A2P8dsM4V77sAAAA==);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><img src=\"/service-assets/campaign-content-plan.svg\" alt=\"A joined-up plan for Google Ads, paid social, articles and blogs\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover object-top max-md:h-auto max-md:object-contain content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></picture></div></div></figure><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" data-v-208a8e74><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"clickable-block flex flex-col gap-4 no-underline text-inherit\" data-v-208a8e74><p class=\"text-sm uppercase leading-normal tracking-widest text-haze-800\" data-v-208a8e74>Connect the journey</p><p class=\"text-2xl leading-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-208a8e74>One plan for ads and content</p><p class=\"text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-208a8e74>Bring your offer, audience, campaign ideas and content into the same conversation. Shape the message, publishing flow and conversion goals before deciding what to create or where to spend.</p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-base leading-normal tracking-tight text-spark\" data-v-208a8e74> Talk to us <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-208a8e74>→</span></span></a><figure class=\"border-l-2 border-spark pl-6\" data-v-208a8e74><blockquote class=\"max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-4xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">Every ad, article and post should have a clear role in the customer journey.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"flex flex-col gap-0 pt-6\"><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\">Our growth principle</p><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal opacity-70 text-haze-800\">Fyntix</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section></div></div>"
    },
