      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-be4afccd><section id=\"section-services-faq\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pb-32 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:8rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:3rem;\" data-v-be4afccd data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-12\" data-v-be4afccd><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-be4afccd><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\" data-v-be4afccd><span class=\"text-spark\">Frequently asked questions</span></h2><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd>Straight answers about search visibility, paid media, content and working with Fyntix.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-be4afccd><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What kind of agency is Fyntix? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Fyntix is a growth strategy agency. We connect search and AI visibility, paid advertising and content strategy so your business can be discovered, understood and chosen. Our two service groups are Search &amp; AI Visibility and Paid Media &amp; Content.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Which services does Fyntix offer? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Our services cover SEO strategy and optimisation; GEO, AEO and AIO; AI search visibility; Google Ads; Meta Ads and TikTok Ads; and content strategy and creation, including articles, blogs and social content. We shape the combination around your audience, offer and business goals.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How do SEO, GEO, AEO and AIO fit together? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>We treat them as connected parts of a search strategy. SEO focuses on organic search foundations, while answer and generative search work makes your expertise clearer for AI-assisted discovery. Technical access, useful answers, structured information and credible sources support the overall approach.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Can you guarantee rankings or mentions in AI answers? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>No. Rankings, ad performance and AI-generated answers are controlled by platforms and can change. We focus on the factors we can work on, agree practical success measures and report what we can observe, without promising a particular ranking, citation or return.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you manage Google Ads, Meta Ads and TikTok Ads? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We plan and manage campaigns around audience intent, budgets, creative, landing pages and conversion goals. Google Ads, Facebook and Instagram campaigns through Meta Ads, and TikTok Ads can form part of one paid media strategy.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you write articles and blogs as well as plan content? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We support both the strategy and the creation: research, topic selection, content briefs, editorial calendars, articles, blogs, social posts and ad copy. We plan how each piece moves people from discovery to consideration and action.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How will we measure progress? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>We agree the measures around your goals, such as qualified enquiries, sales, organic visits and conversions. Paid campaigns can also track acquisition costs and return where reliable attribution is available. AI visibility reviews use a defined set of relevant questions and observed mentions rather than a promise of complete coverage.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Can we start with one service or a growth audit? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. Start with a focused search and AI visibility audit, a paid media review, a content strategy or an agreed combination. We use that starting point to identify priorities, define a practical scope and decide what to work on next.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How do we get started? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Tell us about your business, audience, website, current channels and growth goals through the contact page. We will discuss where search, paid media or content could help and agree a clear scope before the work begins.</span></div></details></div></div></section></div>"
    },
